# Final outputs and figures ARE tracked — they are the published snapshot.
# Re-running tar_make() overwrites them with the latest Eurostat vintage;
# the git diff between commits is the audit trail of how the rolling
# vintage moves over time. Reviewers and replicators see the exact paper
# numbers by checking out the submission commit / tag.

